    "quote": "With an equal allocation of a flips to every coin (e.g., Round-Robin when b = a n) and under uniform priors, the expression for the regret (i.e., E(Θmax) − E(µmax|s)) further simplifies to: n/(n+1) − Σ_{h=0}^{a} ((h+1)^n − h^n)/(a+1)^n · (h+1)/(a+2)."
   },
